Chapter: RsaVerifyTest
  cites Foreword chapter Rsa
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 The key is a real 2048-bit RSA key, the signature is
 `openssl dgst -sha256 -sign`, and OpenSSL verifies it too, so the vector
 is known good independently of anything here.

 We say:

